    "CAR FREE DEVELOPMENT (COMPLIANCE): All future occupiers of the residential units hereby approved shall not be eligible to obtain an on street residents parking permit except: i) In the case of disabled persons; ii) In the case of units designated in this planning permission as 'non car free'; or iii) In the case of the resident who is an existing holder of a residents parking permit issued by the London Borough of Islington and has held the permit for a period of at least one year.\r\n\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development remains car free in accordance with policy T6 of the London Plan 2021, policy T3 of the Islington Local Plan: Strategic and Development Management Policies 2023 and to comply with Schedule 2, Part 20, Class AB.2.(1)(a) of the General Permitted Development Order (2015) as amended."
